window.products.push({"id":134024,"name":"Broan Elite Rangemaster RMDD3004 30\" Downdraft Ventilation System with Internal or External Blower Options Heat Sentry Infinitely Adjustable Control a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1499.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514ygYqVQ2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Broan® Elite RMDD Downdraft Rangemaster® Range Hood System Broan® 30-Inch Telescopic Downdraft Range Hood System, 600 Max Blower CFM, Stainless Steel (15) 3.8 out of 5 stars. 15 reviews Write a review Questions & Answers Designed specifically to be compatible with most conventional and commercial style cooktops, the Broan Elite RMDD Series Downdraft combines a sensational appearance with high performance features. Stainless steel construction on all exposed surfaces provides a durable finish and an unforgettable look. The thin profile saves precious space under the cabinet, while the chimney rises over 9-1/2 in. when activated, ideal for large pots and pans. Color Finish Product Width 30\" 36\" 48\" Model: RMDD3004 BUY NOW Order Replacement Parts (15) 3.8 out of 5 stars. 15 reviews Write a review Questions & Answers Color Finish Product Width 30\" 36\" 48\" Model: RMDD3004 BUY NOW Order Replacement Parts Retractable downdraft hood rises from behind the cooktop and retracts when not in use, offering a seamless design for your kitchen Chimney rises over 9-1/2 inches when activated, ideal for large pots and pans 600 Max Blower CFM to quickly pull smoke and cooking odors out of the air Models RMDD3004EX, RMDD3604EX and RMDD4804EX offer you choice of exterior blowers ranging from 660 to 1620 Max Blower CFM or in-line blowers from 320 to 1540 Max Blower CFM (blower required and sold separately) Easy-to-use rotary control lets you adjust the fan speed Dishwasher-safe filters are easy to remove and feature a stylish brushed stainless steel appearance for a professional look Unique ducting capability allows the internal blower connection to be ducted to the left, right or downward (from left to right) Heat Sentry® adjusts speed of blower to High automatically in case of excess heat, to prolong product life Optional remote control will activate down draft from an alternate location (RMDDRBK sold separately) Compatible with optional Broan Make-up Air Dampers (sold separately) to fit 6\" or 8\" ducting and help to balance the air pressure when the range hood is in use, keeping your environment comfortable Filter Type Stainless Steel Heat Sentry™ Yes HVI Certified Yes Sound Level (Sones) 3 UL Listed Yes ADA Compliance No Damper Included No ENERGY STAR® certified No Light Bulbs Included No Nightlight Or Nighlight Setting No Ductless Recirculation Capable No Ductless Filter Or Kit Included No Remote Operation Capable No Speed Levels Variable Switch Control Type Rotary Rated Voltage 120 Boost Mode No Color Finish Rated Amps 4 Product Depth 2.375 Product Height 29.5\" Product Width 30\" Built-In Timer No CFM 600 Max Diameter 6\" Round Vent Type Ducted Only Duct Direction Horizontal/Vertical Manufacturer Warranty 1 Year Wattage 480","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514ygYqVQ2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Broan","source_asin":"B000LO8WGY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-134024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000LO8WGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B000LO8WGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":134025,"name":"Portable Clothes Washing Machines,Portable Mini Washer Machine with Ozone/Blue Light Deep Clean & Smart Timer Control for Home/Travelling/Apartment Do","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zIdWx0LtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mini Portable Washing Machine- This mini washing machine have stylish and small appearance compared with others. It is designed specially for socks and baby cloths. As Scientists suggested, there are much invisible bacterium on our socks and socks have better be washed separately. Owning this small washing machine, Our life will be become more healthy. Ozone & Blue light- This small washing machines for apartments own Ozone and Blue light double deep washing protection. Double washing protection brought users cleaner socks and more healthy life. Let bacterium far away from us. These are especially important for baby. Smart Control Washing Machine- This tiny washing machine work totally 15 minutes each time and it will stop working automatically. Drumi washing machine have Bidirectional rotation work mode and each direction turn three circles, then switch to the opposite. The whole process needn’t manual operation. Ultrasonic Auxiliary Washing- This mini portable washing machine utilize ultrasonic to make dirt drop from sock, especially dirt in crevice which is difficult to be removed. We strongly recommend to add laundry detergent into water, then put soaks in and soak for 10 minutes before turn on washing machine. That will make better effect on washing. Convenient to use- This portable washing machine adopt one button control design. Users just put finger on button for 2 seconds, the washer machine will turn on right now. Filter on the top of washing machine is helpful for users to pour dirty water after using. Handle is convenient for users to change water as well.In addition, this washing machine enable users to cover it for preventing water overflowing. Mini Shape do not mean small capacity. It can wash 5-7 socks at the same times.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zIdWx0LtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honadar","source_asin":"B09Q13T81B","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-134025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q13T81B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q13T81B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
