window.products.push({"id":134041,"name":"Beaquicy WH01X10310 Washer Control Knob Assembly - Replacement for GE Washer wcsr4170g4ww wbsr3140g0ww wjsr4160g1ww gtwp2000m0ww gcap1000m0ww - Replac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xAsVrS4HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝑾𝑯𝟎𝟏𝑿𝟏𝟎𝟑𝟏𝟎 𝑾𝑨𝑺𝑯𝑰𝑵𝑮 𝑴𝑨𝑪𝑯𝑰𝑵𝑬 𝑪𝑶𝑵𝑻𝑹𝑶𝑳 𝑲𝑵𝑶𝑩】---This WH01X10310 Control Knob Assembly is installed onto the shaft of the control mechanism. It is white with chrome colored ring.The dimension is approximately 2 inch in width and 1.75 inch in height. The knob is fitted onto the dial assembly, allows the user to set the timer, lets the user choose the wash cycle, includes push on clip. This item is compatible with many washing appliances. The packages includes 1 x WH01X10310 GE washer knob. 【𝑨𝑩𝑺 𝑷𝑳𝑨𝑺𝑻𝑰𝑪 𝑨𝑵𝑫 𝑴𝑬𝑻𝑨𝑳】---WH01X10310 control knob is made from ABS Plastic and metal components, well-tested by the manufacturer, reinforced with a metal ring, which prevents the stem from getting broken, eight teeth on back with retaining clip included - Meet OEM standards - Ensure long lasting and effective operation. It is quick and easy to install and can extend the use time. It can fix the following symptoms: ★Timer will not advance. ★Will Not Start. ★Will not shut off. ★Shuts off too soon. 【𝑾𝑰𝑫𝑬 𝑪𝑶𝑴𝑷𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑩𝑰𝑳𝑬】---WH01X10310 Control Knob Assembly can replacement for GE washer. Replaces Numbers: 1264403, AP3994965, AH1482286, EAP1482286, PS1482286. ★WH01X10310 Waher Control Knob fits the models: WLSR3000G0WW, GTAN2800D0WW, GTAN2800D1WW, GTAN2800D2WW, WBSR3140G0WW, S3700G3WW, WCSR4170G0WW, WCSR4170G1WW, WCSR4170G2WW, WCSR4170G3WW, WCSR4170G4WW, WCSR4170G5WW, WCSR4170G6WW, WCSR4170G7WW, WJSR4160G0WW, WJSR4160G1WW, WJSR4160G2WW, WJSR4160G3WW, WJSR4160G4WW, WJSR4160G5WW, WJSR4160G6WW, WHDSR316G5WW, WDSR2080G2WW, WHDRR418G1WW, etc. 【𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀】---WH01X10310 g-e washer knob replacement supports 365 days return and exchange. ★The Washing Machine Timer Control Knob Assembly is made of durable, high-quality materials that are not easily damaged and have a long service life. The eight-speed gears are better able to turn the knobs accurately and accurately to fix them in the appropriate position. The white knob has slightly thinner raised handles. The knob handle has a small oval shaped recess on each side of the knob to allow for a better pinch and create a point of impact when turning the knob. 【𝑩𝑹𝑰𝑵𝑮 𝑪𝑶𝑵𝑽𝑬𝑵𝑰𝑬𝑵𝑪𝑬 𝑭𝑶𝑹 𝒀𝑶𝑼𝑹 𝑳𝑰𝑭𝑬】---WH01X10310 Control Knob Assembly is quick and easy to install and can extend the use time. A pair of pliers and a screwdriver may be needed for the removal and replacement. Removal can be done by pushing the clip under the knob with a very small flat head screw driver, or remove the knob by pulling it straight off its post. Replace knob yourself, not only will save the cost of hiring a repairman, but also save a lot of money to replace the washing machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xAsVrS4HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0885XQZVS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-134041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0885XQZVS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0885XQZVS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
