window.products.push({"id":134055,"name":"Broan-NuTone 36-Inch Wall-Mount Convertible Internal Blower Range Hood with 4-Speed Exhaust Fan and Light, 650 Max Blower CFM, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31S8mGKnBHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Upgrade your kitchen with the Broan-NuTone 36-inch Under-Cabinet Convertible Internal Blower Range Hood! This versatile range hood insert offers a complete solution to your ventilation needs by providing both an exhaust fan and overhead light for your stove. This range hood provides a MAX 650 CFM and 13.5 Sones blower performance to quickly remove smoke and cooking odors from the air, and the 4-speed rotary dial allows for quick fan adjustments and provides the ideal level of ventilation every time you cook. The variable speed control remembers the last setting used for convenience, and the heat sentry detects excessive heat and adjusts blower speed automatically. The two-level built-in lights accept up to 50-watt halogen bulbs (not included) to evenly illuminate your cooking area. This sleek stainless steel range hood fits neatly underneath cabinets, and it features mitered sides and a hemmed bottom with no sharp edges to help ensure safety and provide a more decorative look. The three one-piece dishwasher-safe baffle filters with removable grease drip rail offer easy cleaning so you can maintain optimum grease capture and keep your kitchen ventilated. This convertible range hood unit measures 24\" x 36\" x 18\" with a 3.25\" x 10\" ducted opening that is designed to duct out of the hood shell in either horizontal or vertical direction with internal blowers. It is both UL-Listed and HVI-2100 Certified for safety and protection, and it includes a 1 year limited warranty. Enhance your kitchen with the Broan-NuTone E6436SS Range Hood! From the Manufacturer Professional style that fits under any cabinet. True professional style and performance has never been easier to bring home with the E60000 range hoods, in 10-Inch under-cabinet versions. Styling is fresh and modern, yet designed to easily complement popular pro-style cooking products. These models come with integrated internal blowers or dedicated external blower capability. Both embody professional features such as powerful blowers, baffle filters, brilliant halogen lighting and variable speed controls. And while you won't see this feature it is hard to miss the quiet operation - 2 Sones or less at normal speed. To carry the professional theme even further, select the optional stainless steel backsplash with adjustable shelving. When you want professional style and performance, trust BROAN to cover every detail. 18-Inch wall-mount design, Brushed stainless steel finish. Dedicated models (E60E) in all widths for use with external blower options-choice of eight, from 280-1500 CFM (Blowers sold separately). 600 CFM internal blower is included on all internal models, 1200 CFM on T-versions. Non-duct kit option available: ANKE60362SS. Bright halogen lighting; Two 50-watt bulbs (purchase bulbs separately). Pro-style, dishwasher-safe baffle filters with removable grease drip rail. Variable speed control remembers last setting-blue power-on indicator light: Heat Sentry detects excessive heat and adjusts blower speed automatically. Optional pro-style backsplash and decorative 12-Inch soffit flue. Designed to duct out of the hood shell in either horizontal or vertical direction with any blower configuration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31S8mGKnBHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Broan-NuTone","source_asin":"B001NPRIEW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-134055","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001NPRIEW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B001NPRIEW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
