window.products.push({"id":134184,"name":"GE Dryer Parts WE49X20697 Dryer Bearing Repair Kit Compatible with GE Dryer Include WE3M26 Top Front Bearing WE9M30 Drum Felt WE12M29 Drive Belt WE1M1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OmDqzLn1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What You Will Get? 1 x WE3M26 top front bearing, 1 x WE9M30 front drum felt , 1 x WE12M29 drive belt, 2 x WE1M1067 bearing slides, 2 x WE1M504 glide slides. Drum front bearing kit WE49X20697 supports the front of the dryer drum and reduces friction as the drum rotates. High Quality Kit: WE49X20697 Dryer Bearing Kit are made of durable high quality materials and well tested by the manufacturer. This high-quality dryer bearing kit is built for long-lasting durability. Each component meets or exceeds all original manufacturer's performance specifications. Replaces Part Numbers: ►The WE3M26 Top Front Bearing replaces AP3790641, 1089201, WE3M26, WE03M0020, WE3M20. ►The WE12M29 Dryer Drum Drive Belt replaces WE12X21574, 1381519, 559C197P001, 559C197P003, PS1766009, WE120122, WE12M0022, WE12M22, WE12M33, WW02F00028. ►The WE9M30 Dryer Front Drum Felt replaces WE09M0015, WE09X20441, WE9M15, WE9M30. This Kit works for most of top load GE dryers (*not compatible with dryers that have a matching frontload washer*) . Fits GE Models: BWXR473ET0WW BWXR473ET2WW BWXR473ET3WW DBLR333GE0CC DBLR333GE0WW DBLR333GE1CC DBLR333GE1WW DBLR333GE2CC DBLR333GE2WW DBXR453GV1WW DBXR453GV2WW DBXR453GV3WW DBXR463EB0CC DBXR463EB0WW DBXR463EB1CC etc. If you can't confirm, please feel free to contact me, I will help you confirm it. Fixes the Following Symptoms: ►Noisy ►Marks left on clothes ►Will not tumble ►Takes too long to dry. Easy to install. If you don't know how to install it, we suggest you look up for a YouTube video how to change the parts, it's not hard at all. Unplug the dryer before installing this part. Wear work gloves to protect your hands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OmDqzLn1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"M Motico","source_asin":"B0B1V361X5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-134184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1V361X5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1V361X5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
