window.products.push({"id":134338,"name":"AQUA CREST 5 Years Capacity -Inline Water Filter for Refrigerator with 1/4-Inch Direct Connect Fittings, Idea for Ice Maker, Refrigerator, RO System, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jJmyKD6uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5-Year Service Life 𝐌𝐮𝐥𝐭𝐢𝐩𝐥𝐞 𝐮𝐬𝐞𝐬: The AQUA CREST Inline Water Filter can be used in Refrigerators, Ice Makers, Coffee Makers, Drinking Water Fountains, Water Coolers, Beverage Equipment, Sink Faucets, RV, Campers, Boats and RO System. Compatible with most refrigerator filter brands such as Samsung, GE, LG, Whirlpool, Frigidaire, and so on. 𝐒𝐢𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐞 𝐢𝐧𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: The in line water line filter comes with both 1/4” compression and push-to-connect fittings (7/16\" adapter fitting) for plastic or copper water lines. You can install the filter with a single twist, without cutting the tubing. ⚡𝗡𝗼𝘁𝗲: Please insert the PE tube into the filter cartridge for 20mm, which can prevent water leakage effectively. 𝟓-𝐘𝐞𝐚𝐫 𝐒𝐞𝐫𝐯𝐢𝐜𝐞 𝐋𝐢𝐟𝐞: This inline water filter for refrigerator has a service life of 5 years or 5,000 gallons( This may vary based on water conditions). By spending an average of 0.01 per day, you can enjoy great-tasting water for a long time. Less expense, better filtration. ⚡𝐍𝐨𝐭𝐞: This system will NOT reduce Total Dissolved Solids (TDS). 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐟𝐢𝐥𝐭𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐬𝐮𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐨𝐫 𝐦𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐚𝐥: In line water line filter employs a polyester membrane with a fine pore diameter and a 0.5 micron coconut shell activated carbon block, can effectively reduce chlorine, PFAS, PFOA/PFOS, taste and odor, rust, suspended solids, and colloids. It improves the taste of water from your refrigerator dispenser. BPA-free and lead-free material ensures product safety. 𝐀𝐥𝐥-𝐢𝐧𝐜𝐥𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐩𝐚𝐜𝐤𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐥𝐢𝐬𝐭: 1/4” PE tubing, 1/4” compression and push-to-connect fittings (⚡7/16\" adapter fitting), a 1/4” compression hex nut, a sleeve and an insert.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jJmyKD6uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aqua Crest","source_asin":"B07Y9S7L29","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-134338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y9S7L29","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y9S7L29","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":134339,"name":"Beaquicy W10409079 Washer Drain Pump Replacement for Whirl-pool May-tag Washing Machine Replaces WPW10409079 AP6021043 PS11754363 EAP11754363","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QEDvWyCML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝟏𝟐𝟎𝑽, 𝟎.𝟗𝟓𝑨】: The package includes 1 x W10409079 drain pump, 3 x screw. This Drain Pump serves to remove water from the washing machine during the drain part of the cycle. The pump comes with a rubber elbow and clamp mechanisms to provide a leak-free fit with your existing machine. The black orifice has a diameter of 1.32 inches and the white orifice measures 1.26 inches. The pump is made of ABS plastic and its rated specification is: 120V, 0.95A. Replacing the pump solves the FOLLOWING SYMPTOMS: ➤Will not drain ➤The sound is noisy ➤Cannot be started. 【𝑨𝑩𝑺 𝑷𝑳𝑨𝑺𝑻𝑰𝑪 𝑨𝑵𝑫 𝑺𝑻𝑨𝑰𝑵𝑳𝑬𝑺𝑺 𝑺𝑻𝑬𝑬𝑳】: The W10409079 washing machine drain pump is made of durable high quality ABS plastic and stainless steel material. The pumps are tested by the manufacturer to meet OEM standards, ensuring effective long-term performance. It starts when the washing machine panel gives a spin command, causing water to drain out of the washer. The high quality material makes the pump interface more firmly sealed for better spinning results. When the water flows through the pump, the water will not flow out from the pump interface. There will be no water leakage while dehydrating. 【𝑾𝑰𝑫𝑬 𝑪𝑶𝑴𝑷𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑩𝑰𝑳𝑰𝑻𝒀】---WPW10409079 washer drain pump fits for Whirl-pool, May-tag washing machine. W10403802 is the replacement model with the same specifications ➤Replaces Numbers: W10403802 2118648, AP6021043, PS11754363, EAP11754363, MVWB980BW0, MVWB980BG0, 11028102310, 11028103310, WTW8100BW0, WTW8500BC0, WTW8500BR0, WTW8500BW0, WTW8540BC0, WTW8540BW0, WTW8600YW0, WTW8600YW1, WTW8900BW0, MVWB700BW0, MVWB725BG0, MVWB725BW0, MVWB750YW0, MVWB850YG0, MVWB850YW0, MVWB880BW0, MVWB950YG0, etc. 【𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝑮𝑼𝑨𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝑬𝑬】---WPW10409079 Drain Pump supports 365 DAYS return and exchange. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. 【𝑩𝑹𝑰𝑵𝑮 𝑪𝑶𝑵𝑽𝑬𝑵𝑰𝑬𝑵𝑪𝑬 𝑻𝑶 𝒀𝑶𝑼𝑹 𝑳𝑰𝑭𝑬】---You will need a 1/4-inch nut driver, a 5/16-inch nut driver, a flat-blade screwdriver, and a pair of pliers. Remember to turn off the water supply and disconnect the power to the washer before starting repairs. Installing the drain pump w10409079 is easier than you think. You can watch the installation video and do it yourself in just 20 to 60 minutes. Install yourself saves not only money on hiring a repairman, but also money on replacing your washer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QEDvWyCML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B083FK1HSD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-134339","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083FK1HSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083FK1HSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
