window.products.push({"id":134405,"name":"Clean Dirty Dishwasher Magnet Sign Indicator - Plain Black and White Script Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415KU0cG5RL._AC_.jpg","description":"This Guajolote Prints Dishwasher Magnet is perfect for sticking anywhere you wish and it's also a lovely, affordable present. Our Dishwasher Magnets are printed on white quality paper in full color, protected with scratch resistant mylar and with full strips of magnet on the back. These magnets are printed and manufactured in the U.S.A. Most appliance surfaces are strongly attracted to magnets. The exception are some high end stainless steel surfaces made of austenitic alloys, which can show low or no attraction to magnets. If you have a high end stainless steel appliance and are unsure about its magnetic capabilities, try sticking any magnet you may have to it. The result of that will be the same with any other magnet. Made by Guajolote Prints.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415KU0cG5RL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Guajolote Prints","source_asin":"B00DYN29OU","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-134405","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DYN29OU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DYN29OU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
