window.products.push({"id":134451,"name":"W10869845 Stacking Kit Whirlpool Maytag Dryer Stack W10298318RP MHW6000XG2 WFW6620HW0 WFW70HEBW1 MHW3505FW1 YNED5800HW0 WFW560CHW2 WFW6620HC0 MHW3500F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RL9I1YzoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 W10869845 Stack Kit - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP6047938, W10298318RP, W10761316, 12774, 52774, W10298318. Stacking Kit W10869845 is compatible with Whirlpool, Amana, Crosley and Maytag appliances. Attempting to use this Whirlpool Stacking Kit W10869845 with other brands may not be safe or result in proper installation. Whirlpool Stack Kit W10869845 is designed to fit onto the washer's top and bottom edges, creating a secure platform for the dryer to sit on. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the W10869845 Whirlpool Stack Kit? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Whirlpool W10869845 Stacking Kit will help if your appliance is noisy and moving. Maytag Stacking Kit W10869845 fits dozens of models and can be installed in a few minutes. Be sure to unplug the appliance before the repair process. Wear work gloves to protect your hands. 💡 Whirlpool Laundry Stacking Kit W10869845 is designed to securely stack a dryer on top of a compatible washer, creating a space-saving laundry solution that is perfect for small homes or apartments. The W10869845 Dryer Stacking Kit is easy to install and it includes all needed parts to stack your dryer on your washer ASAP. Whirlpool W10869845 Stack Kit for washer and dryer meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Are washer dryer stacking kits universal? Washer dryer stacking kits are not universal and vary in design and compatibility depending on the brand and model of the washer and dryer. It is important to make sure that the stacking kit you choose is specifically designed for the brand and model of your appliance. Attempting to use an incompatible stacking kit could result in damage to your appliances or create a safety hazard. 💡 Is a stacking kit necessary? A stacking kit is not always necessary, but it can be a useful accessory if you have limited space in your laundry area. By stacking your washer and dryer on top of each other, you can save floor space and make your laundry area more efficient. However, if you have enough space in your laundry area or prefer not to stack your washer and dryer, then a stacking kit may not be necessary. It ultimately depends on your personal preferences.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RL9I1YzoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07V4TMKYN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-134451","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V4TMKYN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V4TMKYN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
