window.products.push({"id":134568,"name":"279838 Dryer Heating Element 279816 3392519 Thermal Fuse Cutoff Kit 5400W 240V Compatible with Whirlpool Kenmore KitchenAid Maytag Estate Replaces 340","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oKp9xRShL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"How To Test 279838 Heating Element: To test your heating element you will need to first remove the heating element from the dryer. With the element removed from the dryer, do a visual inspection of the element. Often times you will be able to see a break in the heating coil. Sometimes it even helps to grab each section of the coil and wiggle it to make sure there isn’t a break in it. If you can’t see a break in the coil, then you will need an Ohm meter or Multi-Meter to test the heating element. Place one probe on each terminal of the heating element, you should get a reading of approximately 10 ohms on a good element. If you get no resistance, then the element is damaged and need to be replaced. 279838 Dryer heating element assembly - 5400 watt 240 volt. Transfer the high limit thermostat from your old heating element over to the new element. Don't settle for lower quality heating elements. Replaces 3403585 279837 8565582 3398064 3403585 AP3094254 W10724237 279838A 279838VP 279816 Thermal Fuse & Thermostat Kit - Dryer thermal fuse (thermal cut-off) 309 degrees and high limit thermostat 250 degrees kit - Wiring is used if your old high limit thermostat has one terminal that presses onto the heating element. Includes thermal fuse, thermostat, screws, wiring kit, and instructions. Make sure to check your dryer vent for any restrictions. Replaces 3399848 3977393 2651 AP3094244 PS334299 EAP334299 3392519 Thermal Fuse - Dryer non resettable thermal fuse, two 3/16\" wire terminals. This fuse is located on the blower housing next to the blower fan. If the dryer overheats, the thermal fuse blows to cut off power to the dryer and/or stop the dryer from running.  Replaces WP3392519 3388651 694511 80005 ET401 G4AP0500 3392519 KONDUONE always offer the best customer service to his customers.If you have any problem about your order,please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oKp9xRShL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BTNTVEN","source_asin":"B07PNM2S1W","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-134568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PNM2S1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PNM2S1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
