window.products.push({"id":134601,"name":"R.W.FLAME Protable Nugget Ice Maker Countertop, Pebble/Pellet Ice Maker Machine with Auto Self-Cleaning,11000Pcs/35Lbs/24Hrs, Ice Scoop and Basket,Ice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qBuWsA9WL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fast Ice Making & Large Capacity: This nugget ice maker will make ice cubes in 10-15 minutes, and takes you very little time to get ice cube. It has a 1.1-quart capacity water tank . You can have 35 pounds square ice cubes in 24-hour. Compact & Convenient Design: Our chewable ice makers with a carrying handle are extremely portable and compact. Measured at 11.3(D)*8.7(W)*12.7(H) inches, our portable ice maker countertop makes you take it easily with yourself. And this also makes it a great choice for home, kitchen, office, coffee shop, parties, bar or even RV n where space is at a premium, but still need a large quantity of ice. Transparent Cover& LED Light: There is a transparent window at the top of the pebble ice maker, so you can see the ice making process directly through it without opening the lid. Our led countertop indicator will remind you to remove the ice when the pebble ice maker basket is full, and notify you when the pebble ice maker is in the stage of water shortage. Self-Cleaning & Easy to Operate: This pellet ice maker has only one button, so you just need to press it and wait for ice cube. And equipped with a self-cleaning function,this pellet ice maker only need you to add water into the tank and long-press the \"On/Off\" button for 5s to initiate automatic cleaning. High Quality: With ETL certification. The material used by chewable the ice maker will not cause any pollution to the environment. Quiet cooling system allows you to have a tranquil and comfortable environment. You can remove the drain plug and drain the water to prevent bacterial proliferation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qBuWsA9WL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"R.W.FLAME","source_asin":"B0C1SD4213","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-134601","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1SD4213","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1SD4213","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
