window.products.push({"id":134702,"name":"Bake Element WB44K5012 Oven Heating Element Replacement RANGE OVEN BAKE ELEMENT wb44k5012 for GE Hot.point Kenmore Oven - Replaces 325883,340521,8029,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619p8O2QTLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ 𝐒𝐔𝐏𝐏𝐎𝐑𝐓 𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝐃𝐀𝐘𝐒 𝐑𝐄𝐓𝐔𝐑𝐍 & 𝐄𝐗𝐂𝐇𝐀𝐍𝐆𝐄- 𝐑𝐈𝐒𝐊-𝐅𝐑𝐄𝐄 𝐒𝐇𝐎𝐏𝐏𝐈𝐍𝐆.Beaquicy attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.If you have any quality problem during warranty period,please contact customer service in time.Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. 𝐖𝐁𝟒𝟒𝐊𝟓𝟎𝟏𝟐 𝐑𝐀𝐍𝐆𝐄 𝐎𝐕𝐄𝐍 𝐁𝐀𝐊𝐄 𝐄𝐋𝐄𝐌𝐄𝐍𝐓---Bake Element kit includes 1 x WB44K5012 Oven Heating Element.WB44K5012 Oven Bake Element is located on the bottom of the oven that supplies the heat for your electric oven. It turns on an off throughout the time that the oven is on to ensure consistent heat at the temperature that was set and ▶wb44k5012 oven heating element has dimensions of L: 19.75\" x W: 17.625\" x H: 2.5\",Spacing at mount is 2-3/4\",Approximate Shipping Weight:1.45lb,Net Weight:0.6lb,▶2585W and the voltage@ is 240V. 𝐌𝐀𝐃𝐄 𝐅𝐑𝐎𝐌 𝐒𝐓𝐀𝐈𝐍𝐋𝐄𝐒𝐒 𝐒𝐓𝐄𝐄𝐋 𝐀𝐋𝐋𝐎𝐘𝐒---WB44K5012 Oven Heating Element is made from STAINLESS STEEL ALLOYS with push on wire terminals and REPLACES PART: wb44k5012,8029,325883,326365,340521,4334928,WB44K5012E,WB44K6012, WB44M0001,WB44M1,WB44X0230,WB44X0234,WB44X234,1944,AP2030968,PS249247,EAP24924.Your bake element might have to be replaced if: ★There is little to no heat when baking,★The element will not heat,★The element is worn or corroded. 𝐌𝐀𝐃𝐄 𝐅𝐎𝐑 𝐏𝐄𝐑𝐅𝐄𝐂𝐓 𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐏𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐁𝐈𝐋𝐈𝐓𝐘---Bake element wb44k5012 general electric,Hot,point,Kenmore,and more Ovens.▶FITS THE FOLLOWING MODELS#𝐊𝐄𝐍𝐌𝐎𝐑𝐄:1034688610 3636204190 9114654590 9116208812 91163275790 9119808710 #𝐆𝐄:22388L0 22388W0 JCSP39BW1BB JBS04V2AD JSP31WT1WW LEB131GY1WH RS386PXBB0 #𝐇𝐎𝐓𝐏𝐎𝐈𝐍𝐓:RB502S1WH RF512GP2BG RB754GT1WH RF725GT1BG RS504P2AD #𝐑𝐎𝐏𝐄𝐑:2204*1A 2204*2A 2354W2A 2354W3A F9808*0 N9608W0 S7257*0 #𝐒𝐄𝐀𝐑𝐒:9114618812 9114638812 9116248812 9119119181 #𝐖𝐇𝐈𝐑𝐋𝐏𝐎𝐎𝐋 RS386PXBB0 RS386PXBB1 RS386PXBQ0 RS386PXBQ1.𝐌𝐨𝐫𝐞 𝐜𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐦𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬 𝐚𝐫𝐞 𝐥𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐢𝐧 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐝𝐞𝐬𝐜𝐫𝐢𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧. 𝐒𝐀𝐕𝐄 𝐌𝐎𝐍𝐄𝐘 𝐒𝐀𝐕𝐄 𝐓𝐈𝐌𝐄---Unplug your oven or turn off the circuit breaker before beginning repairing WB44k5012 Oven Heating Element. You'll prepare a phillips screwdriver.Unscrewed the two screws that held the element in place,needed pliers to remove the stakon connectors from old element. Attached them to new element and put screws back in place. A simple installation that takes a few minutes can save you a big step in the cost of hiring a repairman.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619p8O2QTLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B087LRPRJV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-134702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087LRPRJV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B087LRPRJV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
