window.products.push({"id":134758,"name":"(𝟮𝟬𝟮𝟯 𝙐𝙥𝙜𝙧𝙖𝙙𝙚𝙙)341241 Dryer Drum Drive Belt by Beaquicy - Replacement for Ken-More Whirlpool Dryer - Replaces 8066065 AP2946843 W10127457 PS346995","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rdasAyeyL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【341241 DRYER DRUM BELT】---341241 Dryer Drum Belt is approximately 1/4\" wide x 92-1/4\" long.This belt is flat and has 4 ribs and 3 grooves.341241 Dryer drum belt connected to drum, idler pulley, and motor pulley. Belt 341241 attaches to the motor pulley, as the armature of the motor turns, the belt begins to move and turn the drum.If you notice that the drum of the dryer does not rotate during the drying process, but you hear the motor running, your belt may have broken and need to be replaced. 【USE WEAR-RESISTANT RUBBER MATERIAL】---341241 Dryer roller belt is made of durable high quality rubber, anti-wear, anti-corrosion, will not easily break or crack in the process of use.Dryer roller belt can fix the dryer that won't roll over, noisy, won't start, doesn't have heat, or doesn't have enough heat.☛TIPS:Due to dryer noise, please check the drum support roller before replacing drum belt 341241 and replace it if you see signs of damage or wear. 【180 DAYS WARRANTY】---The product 341241 Dryer Drum Drive Belt supports 180 days RETURN and EXCHANGE.Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. 【SUITABLE FOR DRYER MODELS】----► The 341241 Dryer Drum Belt Replacement for Ken-more Whirl-pool, Inglis, Roper, Estate, Admiral,Amana, and other brand dryers.►This 341241 dryer belt works with the following models: 2008, 341241VP, 8210, 345473, 349533, 53-0186, 53-1080, 53-1086, 53-1528, 53-1589, 53-2671, 53-2910, 529597, AP2946843, PS346995, EAP346995, 694088-NC,etc, 110.96281100, 110.60222511, 110.67322600, 110.64602300, 110.76002010, wgd4815ew2, wed4815ew1, wed4810ew1, wed5530sq0,etc. 【DIY INSTALLATION】---Wear working gloves to protect your hands when installing the 341241 drum belt of the dryer. The installation process does not require any tools. Make sure the groove faces down, facing the roller. You can also find repair videos online, follow it through the installation, and quickly fix your dryer in just a few minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rdasAyeyL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B083LYQFSS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-134758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083LYQFSS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083LYQFSS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
