window.products.push({"id":134813,"name":"Countertop Dishwasher, Aikoper Compact Portable Dishwasher with 6L Built-in Water Tank & Water Hose Inlet, Mini Dishwasher with 5 Cleaning Cycles, Qui","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-mLy+QmyS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"PORTABLE & COMPACT DESIGN - Dimensions: Measure 17.13\"*16.54\"*18.42\" Come with 3 place setting capacity(can fit 12-inches in diameter at an angle), it's ideal for different places, such as small size kitchen, apartment, dorms, garage, office room, RVs. CONVENIENT DESIGN FOR YOU - You can choose manually add the water into the 6L built-in water tank(offering a water pouring helper avoids spilling over water), you can also connect with the water pipe with the inlet to automatically add the water. Dual ways adding water provide you more convenience to meet your actual need. EFFECTIVE WASHING - The upper and lower spray arms offer 360°full range of cleaning for your tableware and items in 5 modes, including Normal, Hygiene, Fruit, Glass, Rapid. Different modes can provide you a effective and deep cleaning to meet your daily washing needs. THOROUGH CLEANING - 5 washing mode can easily meet your requirement. Especially in the Hygiene mode, as the temp can reach 162℉ in the washing process, it's easy to remove the stubborn stains and oil pollution for effective cleaning. Compare with the other dishwashers, this dishwasher has 2 times high temp washing and rinsing to offer thorough and better cleaning. MULTIFUNCTIONAL DESIGN - The innovative designs are coming! This dishwasher comes with a new high-tech design to automatically open the door after washing process finish, at the same time, the fan motor will keep running when the door is opened, the purpose is to achieve better drying for your tableware. Another amazing design is air refresh, when all the process done, you can choose this function to keep inside dry, clean, ventilated and prevent any pleasant smells. NOTES AND TIPS：The unit has been tested with water before leaving the factory, so a little residual water in the unit is NORMAL. And the faucet adapter is not included with the package.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-mLy+QmyS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aikoper","source_asin":"B08NSPR5WC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-134813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NSPR5WC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NSPR5WC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
