window.products.push({"id":134923,"name":"Commercial Ice Machine 88lbs/24h with 24lbs Storage, 32 Ice Cubes Ready in 12-18 Mins Freestanding Large Stainless Steel Ice Maker for Restaurant/Bar/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418YnEVfuxS.jpg","description":"Ice is an integral part of everyday life. Ice coffee, cold beer, ice water, frozen seafood, ice fruit and so on. Ice makes food and drink \"magic\".Do you want to achieve \" ice freedom \"? Want fresh ice on the go? You may only need a Linsion commercial ice maker. The ice maker can make 32 clean blocks in an 12-18 minute cycle and can make up to 88 pounds of ice in 24 hours. With a powerful compressor, it can handle both normal home ice making needs and the bulk of ice that stores need at peak times.Ice cube size is 0.9''*0.9''*0.9''. Independent stainless steel body design, durable and beautiful, easy to use. Ideal for family parties, bars, cafes, offices and restaurants. Tips from Linsion Customer Service : 1.Place the ice machine on level platform. 2.Let machine stand upright for 24 hours before first use. 3. Clean machine before first use, periodically based on usage and after periods of storage. 4.Rinse thoroughly, drain and dry after cleaning. 5. As ice machine needs time to pre-cooling, it’s slightly less effective in initial 3 times, ice machine will be more effective after several uses. Specifications : Rated power/frequency : 115V/60HZMaterial: Rust-Resistant Stainless Steel + Iron PaintingIce Making Power: 300WPower Supply：115V/60HZIce Making Capacity：88Lbs/24HIce Storage Capacity: 24LbsIce Shape: Square Ice 0.9\"*0.9\"*0.9\"Refrigerant: R134aFoaming: C5H10Climate Type: SN/N/ST/TUnit Dimension(L*W*H): 13.7\"x16.5\"x25.2\"(354*428*637mm) Ice Time: 12-18Min/ Batch Full Set Of Accessories :  1 x Ice Scoop 1 x Filter 1 x Drain Pipe 1 x Instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418YnEVfuxS.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Linsion","source_asin":"B096Z8QXMW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-134923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096Z8QXMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B096Z8QXMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
